<title>BRAZIL: Telesp Jan-April net 298.9 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telesp Jan-April net 298.9 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federal telecommunications company Telesp, a unit of the federal Telebras system, on Tuesday released the following preliminary consolidated financial results for the January-April period.</p>
<p>		   Jan-April 1997     Jan-April 1996</p>
<p>Net		   298.9 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Nolding Net	 303.05 million	   N/A</p>
<p>Gross Revs	     1.976 bln	     N/A</p>
<p>Net Oper Revs	  1.484 bln	     N/A</p>
<p>Oper Profit	 452.3 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Pre-Tax Profit    464 million		N/A</p>
<p>Note: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>The company's full name is Telecomunicacoes de Sao Paulo SA.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement its net worth totaled 9.566 billion reais in the January-April period.</p>
<p>It also said consolidated installed fixed lines reached 5.46 million while cellular terminals totaled 882,000 in the period.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
